---
import LegalPage from "../components/legal/LegalPage.astro";

const sections = [
  { id: "about", title: "About these terms" },
  { id: "using-the-site", title: "Using the site" },
  { id: "content", title: "Our content" },
  { id: "no-advice", title: "Information only" },
  { id: "services", title: "Our services" },
  { id: "third-party", title: "Third-party links and tools" },
  { id: "liability", title: "Liability" },
  { id: "privacy", title: "Privacy" },
  { id: "law", title: "Governing law" },
  { id: "changes", title: "Changes" },
  { id: "contact", title: "Contact us" },
];
---
<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Use — Algorims"
  heading="Terms of Use"
  description="The terms that apply when you use algorims.com, the website of Algorims Pte. Ltd."
  intro="These terms apply when you visit or use algorims.com. By using the site, you agree to them."
  updated="26 November 2026"
  sections={sections}
>
  <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-title">
    <h2 id="about-title">About these terms</h2>
    <p>algorims.com is operated by <strong>Algorims Pte. Ltd.</strong>, a company registered in Singapore ("Algorims", "we", "us"). If you do not agree with these terms, please do not use the site.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="using-the-site" aria-labelledby="using-the-site-title">
    <h2 id="using-the-site-title">Using the site</h2>
    <p>You may browse the site and share links to it for personal or business purposes. When you use it, you agree not to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>use it in a way that breaks any law or infringes anyone's rights;</li>
      <li>try to gain unauthorised access to the site, its servers or connected systems, or interfere with how it works;</li>
      <li>send spam, malicious code or misleading information through our forms or chat;</li>
      <li>scrape or copy the site in bulk, or use automated tools that place an unreasonable load on it.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We may change, suspend or withdraw any part of the site without notice, and we do not guarantee it will always be available or error-free.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="content" aria-labelledby="content-title">
    <h2 id="content-title">Our content</h2>
    <p>The text, illustrations, graphics, logos and other material on this site belong to Algorims or our licensors and are protected by intellectual property laws. You may view and print pages for your own reference. You may not reproduce, modify or republish our content for commercial use without our written permission.</p>
    <p>Product names, logos and trademarks of other companies, including our technology partners and clients, belong to their owners and are shown for identification only.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="no-advice" aria-labelledby="no-advice-title">
    <h2 id="no-advice-title">Information only</h2>
    <p>Content on this site, including blog posts, case studies, pricing guides and figures, is general information. It is not professional, legal, tax or financial advice, and results described in case studies depend on each client's circumstances. Please contact us before relying on it for a specific decision. Our chat assistant provides automated answers that may be incomplete or inaccurate.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="services" aria-labelledby="services-title">
    <h2 id="services-title">Our services</h2>
    <p>Sending an enquiry or booking a call does not create a contract. Any services we provide are governed by a separate written agreement, which takes precedence over these terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="third-party" aria-labelledby="third-party-title">
    <h2 id="third-party-title">Third-party links and tools</h2>
    <p>The site links to and embeds services run by others, such as WhatsApp, LinkedIn, our chat assistant and scheduling tools. We are not responsible for their content, availability or practices, and their own terms and policies apply when you use them.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="liability" aria-labelledby="liability-title">
    <h2 id="liability-title">Liability</h2>
    <p>The site is provided "as is". To the extent the law allows, we exclude all warranties about it and we are not liable for any loss arising from your use of, or inability to use, the site or its content, including indirect or consequential loss, or loss of profit, data or business opportunity.</p>
    <p>Nothing in these terms limits liability that cannot be limited by law.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="privacy" aria-labelledby="privacy-title">
    <h2 id="privacy-title">Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a> explains how we handle personal data, and our <a href="/cookies">cookie policy</a> explains the browser storage we use.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="law" aria-labelledby="law-title">
    <h2 id="law-title">Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore. Any dispute about them or the site is subject to the non-exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Singapore.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes" aria-labelledby="changes-title">
    <h2 id="changes-title">Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top shows the latest version, which applies from the time it is published.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <h2 id="contact-title">Contact us</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Email <a href="mailto:contactus@algorims.com?subject=Website%20terms">contactus@algorims.com</a>.</p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
